Etch-a-Sketch

A simple drawing grid made using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

- Starts with a 16×16 grid.
- Hover over the squares to draw.
- Change the grid size up to 100×100.
- Erase individual squares using the Erase button.
- Switch between drawing and erasing.

Files:
- index.html
- style.css
- script.js